      "pos": {
        "x": 40.0,
        "y": 40.0
      },
      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "First choose a sound in the Main Input panel on the left, under Audio: a microphone, a Sound file, or System audio (what you hear). Each time the bass crosses its threshold \u2014 the square on the Bass bar, which you drag in the panel \u2014 the Main Input fires Bass Event. Each one rolls the turning polygon a new number of sides and its colors a new turn of the hue wheel. Drag the threshold up so only the big hits fire, or cable High Event in its place."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
